sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Validate a plugin submission
  participant H as GitHub Actions
  participant P as Repository
  participant N as Node Scripts
  participant T as Artifact Store
  participant I as Issue
  H->>P: checkout
  H->>H: setup-node + npm ci
  H->>N: node scripts/intake-submission.mjs
  N-->>H: parsed submission
  H->>N: validate-submission.mjs + catalog-verification.mjs
  N-->>H: validation reports
  H->>T: upload validation-reports artifact
  H->>I: comment pass/fail
  Note over H: A failed validation blocks the approval workflow.
